e of history. Configure throw options and board distances and relax to the sounds of nature as you throw the bag of beans. Life has never been so good. \n", "short_description": "Finally, play cornhole in VR in some amazing medieval places with real bean bag physics, unique challenges, and a global leaderboard! \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.milkyway-publishing.com/cornhole-kings-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Milkyway Publishing", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.cornholekingsvr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "623731939601103"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982512_275474591203255_5096381427050533869_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uOl7bzMZPJQQ7kNvwE_TYBl&_nc_oc=AdkTqTwGmrVgDouW6ZaBp7R-DeDDKDC1U4Y20u3PFgGSuDb7QpOF_R9-pogw9wdnH-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxTCrMNdU4TaxaF6bx_GGLlSlhWBQAA41t0e-11cPFzOA&oe=69B805E3"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Cornhole Kings", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context